                                "format": "text/html",
                                "value": "<p>[fol. 367r]</p><p>Congregatio<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Die Octava Septembris 1628</p><p></p><p>Fuit facta Congregatio g<em>e</em>n<em>er</em>alis Accademia<em>e</em>, et Universitatis<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Pictoru<em>m</em> Urbis in Ecc<em>lesi</em>a S<em>an</em>ti Luca<em>e</em> habita in mansionibus d<em>ic</em>ta Ecc<em>lesi</em>a<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>in qua intervenerunt infr<em>ascript</em>i v<em>ide</em>l<em>ice</em>t<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>il Sig.r Girolamo Nanni<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>il Sig.r Giovanni Contini<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>il Sig.r Cavalier Baglioni<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>il Sig.r Cavalier Padovano<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>il Sig.r Nicolo della Faggia<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>il Sig.r Pier Fran.co de Rosci<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>il Sig.r Antonio Pomarancio<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>il Sig.r Prospero Orsi<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>il Sig.r Gismondo Laier<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>il Sig.r Aless.ro Turcho<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>il Sig.r Antonio della Cornia<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>il Sig.r Gio: Antonio Gallo<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>il Sig.r Giulio Cesare Convento<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>il Sig.r Theofilo Bigotti<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>il Sig.r Giovanni Lisignani<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>il Sig.r Enrigo Ovies<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>il Sig.r Gio: Bat'ta Lotti<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>il Sig.r Marcello Lanier<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>il Sig.r Aless.ro B[o]nafede<sup>[1]</sup><span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>il Sig.r Silvio Capis<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>il Sig.r Ascanio Berigioni<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>il Sig.r Michel Angelo Guidi</p><p></p><p>[1]&nbsp;Hole in paper.</p>"
